    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854090/extras/b28020e057927e0b118a99319d7907e2.avif?t=1752295818\" data-has-big width=800 height=337 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Woke Gamer</strong> \u2013 a gaming news site that focuses on pushing DEI agenda under the guise of news, previews and reviews. You play as Mark, a new diversity hire, tasked to write articles for the site. But what kind of articles you choose to write for the publication determines your career in the industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Based or Woke:</strong> You decide what kind of articles you want to write. Whether you want to represent the ideology of game websites or the best interest of gamers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your power wisely:</strong> Call out gamers for their misogyny, homophobia and bigotry. Or, side with them and call out the forced DEI initiatives in the industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices matter:</strong> Every choice you are going to make in the game will be remembered by other characters. Choose your options carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong>: If you are not happy with your first run, try playing it again and make different decisions. Who knows what you might discover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible by everyone:</strong> This game does not have a hard mode so even gaming journalists can play it.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854090/extras/b28020e057927e0b118a99319d7907e2.avif?t=1752295818\" data-has-big width=800 height=337 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Woke Gamer</strong> \u2013 a gaming news site that focuses on pushing DEI agenda under the guise of news, previews and reviews. You play as Mark, a new diversity hire, tasked to write articles for the site. But what kind of articles you choose to write for the publication determines your career in the industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Based or Woke:</strong> You decide what kind of articles you want to write. Whether you want to represent the ideology of game websites or the best interest of gamers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your power wisely:</strong> Call out gamers for their misogyny, homophobia and bigotry. Or, side with them and call out the forced DEI initiatives in the industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices matter:</strong> Every choice you are going to make in the game will be remembered by other characters. Choose your options carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong>: If you are not happy with your first run, try playing it again and make different decisions. Who knows what you might discover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible by everyone:</strong> This game does not have a hard mode so even gaming journalists can play it.</p>",
    "short_description": "Gaming Journo Simulator is a single-player game that lets you play as a journalist and write articles for a game website. Whether you choose to write \u201cwoke\u201d articles or \u201cbased\u201d \u2013 that\u2019s up to you. Just remember: if you want to climb the corporate ladder, you need to play by the rules.",
